# The order letters of the battle panel: in order mode (synthetic save DKSAVE0-hurt, its battle) each order key draws the selected member's
# letter alone in its row (R016+0x15BE: the row background's patch DS:A6C2, the letter in colour 0xFF) until the row is drawn again; W after F
# clears the flee bit (the letter W); Enter ends order mode (the panel rows drawn anew)
